window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A quest to Hell...</b></p> <p><b>A supernatural heist...</b></p> <p><b>An attack to rock the supernatural world...</b></p> <p>With two sacred stones at large, the world is inching toward chaos.</p> <p>Closer to home, though, Luca needs our help. He’s on the brink of death, and the only way to save Luca is to venture into Hell.</p> <p>I feel responsible for Luca’s illness, so I’m all in. The thing is, I’m pretty sure the leader of this mission has a dark secret.</p> <p>Just like Tobias. The secret master himself.</p> <p>One minute the handsome vampire is hot. The next he’s cold. Then hot again.</p> <p>Personally, I’m feeling conflicted too. Not just about him, but many things: the mission to hell, the recent coven heist and, most of all, what the heist revealed.</p> <p><i>But all that drops away when a radical supernatural group attacks. It’s my cue to seek the sacred stones. The time to strike.</i></p> <p><b>We cannot delay or the world might very well fall into madness.</b></p>"; 
